{"server":"cn","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_st03","groupId":"act43side","stageId":"act43side_st03","title":"致观众","storyCode":"AD-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act43side/level_act43side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"6f6b99d4488e497227971992ed14fa346a347caa51f9967043016f6307e7fc65","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomC"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>哥伦比亚，蓝卡坞郊外，联邦移动监狱</><p=2>两个月后</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莫丽，你瘦了好多啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟在床上躺了两个月嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时地块停下来的第一时间我就去找你了。我看到医护人员抬着你出来，你浑身都是血，一动不动，我以为你已经......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的歌声......很可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他只是想让我停下来，没有对我下死手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他绝对不是像格蕾塔说的那样，在剧本拍卖会上与她偶遇，被说服后跟来剧组的，他另有目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另有目的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在找某个存在，某个就在我们身边但我们一无所知的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我本来就觉得卢西恩很神秘，你这么一说我更云里雾里了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了不说他了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真对不起啊莫丽，过了这么久才来看你。主要是、主要是联邦移动监狱的探视申请有点麻烦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的，蒂比。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我利用了你，害你被误会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢西恩先生说得没错，我甚至忽略了我本就拥有的真实。在我陷入癫狂的最后时刻，我甚至，没能想起你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫丽，你听我说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论你经历了什么，无论你出于什么目的，你都伤害了那些和我们朝夕相处的人，你犯下了罪孽，我永远、永远都不会原谅你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是莫丽，这并不影响我怀念那些我们两个人窝在沙发里看恐怖片的时光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么快乐，那么真实，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躺在病床上的时候，伤口很疼，睡不着，我就一直在回想这段时间发生的一切......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一整夜过去，只有我自己的疼痛是最真实的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，无论故事被写得多么荒唐，无论我们是不是命运的傀儡，我并不是没有机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们在一起看电影的时候，我能更专心一些，而不是去想那些我以为自己看到的真相，仇恨和疯狂，鲜血和人偶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，蒂比。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我可以早点遇见你的话，或许你就不需要“劳拉”了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过两天就是最终的庭审了吧？我咨询过几位律师，好像......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用在意结果，蒂比。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"典狱长人很好，他允许我最后这几天待在监狱的后勤部门，去做一些犯人们用得着的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不是，像之前那样，虚妄地等待最后的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好、那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你探视的时间好像不多了，说点开心的事情吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剧组拍的那部电影最后怎么样了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g1_setting_lobby"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>哥伦比亚，蓝卡坞主城区，“另类电影节”展映现场</><p=2>一天前</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，大家都已经在了啊，对不起我来迟了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯蒂芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1835_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯蒂芬，紧张吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯蒂芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1835_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放轻松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后的拍摄以那样荒唐的方式结束，剪辑、调色、音乐制作......两个月的时间完成后期制作，每个人都已经尽力了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯蒂芬，很高兴在电影名的修改上，我们达成了共识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯蒂芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1835_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米兰妮女士，也感谢您最后在天灾中的那段表演。否则，删去那两个字只是我个人的一些矫情的自我斗争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《杜邦夫人》显然没《杜邦夫人之死》那么有噱头，宣发的事情就让格蕾塔去头疼吧......但毫无疑问，这是最适合故事的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会让《杜邦夫人》顺利上映......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后我会去一趟警局，做我该做的事情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的记者A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你掐一下我，我没眼花吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的记者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"掐个屁，快拍快拍！这绝对是明天的头条！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的记者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“另类电影节”这种有点冷门的艺术类评奖，居然能吸引到这么重量级的嘉宾出席？组委会砸了多少钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的记者A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"玛丽安娜女士已经有多少年没在蓝卡坞出现过了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅拉奶奶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，小蒂比。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这身装扮......唔，让我猜猜你如今在剧组里是什么身份，场记？道具师？特技演员，“家具城战士”那种？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是场景喷绘师啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我干了大半年了，我还被选进了蓝卡坞的拍摄地块修复团队呢，上周的事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们剧组租借的那个地块不是已经被天灾毁得不像样子了嘛，老大让我负责它在重建后的设计工作，忙得团团转......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，看起来你终于确定了自己要从事什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟您说过的，我喜欢电影，我喜欢它的每一个环节每一个组成部分......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，我终于找到了自己在其中最最喜欢的是什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，还是不打算回去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，老头子那边，您继续帮我打打掩护嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小蒂比，你的爷爷是我曾经在蓝卡坞最好的合作伙伴，多年的好朋友，但这并不代表他会在教育孩子的事情上听我的意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您就在下次和他喝茶的时候这么说，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“老家伙，我们都已经退休啦，就没必要管那么多啦......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“你看，小蒂比没有利用你的任何资源，没有按照你的规划去当历史片导演，不也在蓝卡坞生活得很好？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“未来，说不定蓝卡坞一半的拍摄场景都是你孙女喷绘的呢！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，我已经录下来了，下次直接放给他听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎呀，雅拉奶奶~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，再说我这次回哥伦比亚，可能也没有时间去见你爷爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对哦，您之前不是跑到雷姆必拓散心了吗，这次回来是为了莱茵生命的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别多问，小蒂比。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"展映会结束后，我还得跑一趟特区，去见见副总统阁下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，这会儿先让我和老朋友聊聊天吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，玛丽安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我雅拉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"息影几十年，“玛丽安娜”这个名字对我来说已经有些陌生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，还是要感谢你......雅拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，凭我如今的影响力，确实很难在蓝卡坞说上什么话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果没有你的帮助，“另类电影节”不会在征选环节已经结束之后，破例允许《杜邦夫人》在电影节上展映。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我事先还真不知道蒂比这孩子竟然是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我愿意帮忙，倒和这个孩子没什么关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只不过是看了那段在天灾中的表演，觉得如果它不能被观众看到，实在是太过可惜，所以想要帮帮老朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，即使《杜邦夫人》在“另类电影节”上提前造势，可能对电影最后的票房成绩也起不到什么帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米兰妮，你比我更清楚，蓝卡坞如果是一个切实的人，那没有比他记性更差、包容心更小的人了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他不一定真能接纳一个重回自己怀抱的恋人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，你们毁坏了一整个地块，哪怕电影票房大卖，你们收回的钱也不够交付赔偿金的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起码我这样去做了，起码我没有遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相比考虑这些，我......我更想问你一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当初，你拍摄《在永夜里燃烧的晨星》时也遭遇了天灾，摄影机记录下了你与风暴擦肩而过的画面......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那究竟如你在发布会上所说，是一个意外，还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是主动走向前与它对戏的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米兰妮，对现在的你来说，答案还重要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，到头来，还是很难说赢过了你啊！"},{"type":"narration","text":"盛装的女主演在媒体的镜头前开怀大笑，她也不知道自己笑什么。\n良久，她向着曾经的竞争对手，臆想中那个自己永远追不上的天才，曾经无数次在镜头前礼貌地行贴面礼的对象，张开了怀抱......\n她们相拥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"入场吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"米兰妮·卢瑟福德   饰   杜邦夫人\n迈克尔   饰   第一、第二、第三洛克菲勒\n道尔顿   饰   杜邦爵士\n卢西恩   饰   信使\n......\n制片人   格蕾塔·斯通\n导演/编剧   斯蒂芬·奎\n统筹   谢莉\n美术部门   卡尔，鲍勃，蒂比，杰里科尔......\n摄制部门   阿布纳，列尔......\n服装部门   玛丽昂......\n道具部门   莫伊拉......\n......\n场务部门   霍汀......\n......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_i11_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......结束了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得这部电影怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我听说了一些这个剧组经历的事情，命案啊天灾啊什么的，项目管理一塌糊涂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"进场之前，我以为电影本身会远不如这些八卦有意思。结果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一场荒唐的贵族婚变，最后以天灾收尾——所有的反转都在情理之中，但好多人物的行为都透露着几分诡异......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然很难给出一个好或者坏的评价，但还挺值得玩味的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，我也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抛开故事不谈，它的制作也应该很有争议，毕竟连拍摄风格都不统一......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"前面是精致细腻的正剧拍法，越到后面反而越粗糙，尤其是天灾那几场高潮戏，完全变成了纪录片！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喜欢的观众会给它打满分，讨厌的观众估计也不会留情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"话又说回来，很有意思，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这几年，蓝卡坞越来越没有意思了，就连在这“另类电影节”上放的电影，也越来越不另类......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"起码这部《杜邦夫人》，我愿意为它买一张电影票。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等会儿映后谈的时候，看主创们怎么说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对了，听说最前排那个一脸倒霉样的家伙，就是剧组的成员来着......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍汀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......真倒霉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍汀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"申请了一个月，好不容易作为最后一个场工被招进剧组，结果一进去就发生了那么多事，还撞见了尸体，失眠了好几晚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍汀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要不是失眠，也不会在靠近天灾的时候，明明都跟着大家躲进了动力层，安全了，结果还是因为恍惚踢到墙壁，脚骨折了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍汀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要不是脚骨折了，也不会错过公交车，连这场电影的前一半都没有赶上......"},{"type":"narration","text":"字幕在滚动着，倒霉的场工喃喃自语，她想起自己这段时间的经历，不禁有些悲从中来。\n就连银幕上那些画面，她也觉得陌生，那些熟悉的面孔、熟悉的场景以一种她无法理解的方式被组合在了一起......\n就像她“跌宕起伏”的人生。\n然后，她在演职员表的最后看到了自己的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍汀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“场务部门：霍汀”......"},{"type":"narration","text":"命运的手再怎么翻覆，也终归要落下一行，你所确信的，真实。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_i11_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧作家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放映结束了，你不去参加映后谈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不属于他们。更何况......你们来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧作家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈，也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧作家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对了，很精彩......无论是戏里，还是戏外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暮落","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卢西恩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暮落","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他这次是真的死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暮落","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，他依旧以某种方式活着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是我需要思考的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"暮落，你只需知道，你不必在即使躲藏于罗德岛上的时候，也依然忧心会被过往的阴影侵入梦境......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剧作家，你可以尽情创作自己的剧本，任何题材、任何风格......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"猩红剧团不复存在，你们自由了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暮落","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧作家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧作家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧作家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你刚刚说，你仍需要思考有关他的结局——也就是说，你无法从这条路上离开，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧作家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“戏剧不死”......坐在我旁边的，不再是“血钻”，而是，“酒神”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暮落","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卢西恩，听起来，你付出了很多代价......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谈不上。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_i11_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如若说，此前我们连复仇或逃遁都是被写就的剧本，那么此刻，我们终于得以走进未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会重新开始游历、歌唱、演出，直到我确信我所形塑的事物，足以匹配我的喜悦和痛苦......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_i11_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它可能是一个新的剧团或主张，一些新的奇遇与故事，或者，更刺眼的明天，更惨烈的真相......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暮落","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧作家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧作家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，暮落，怎么说也算是老熟人了......要帮他吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暮落","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卢西恩，你、你有信心吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奔突于迷途者，闭塞了感识与内心的苦行人，在伟大与低微中跋涉的凡俗，咀嚼着痛苦的生灵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这片大地从来都不缺演员。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_i11_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......欢迎你们，加入“剧团”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
